  </section>

  <section id="who" aria-labelledby="who-head">
    <p class="section-num">09</p>
    <h2 class="section-head" id="who-head">Who's behind this</h2>
    <div class="bios">
      <div>
        <div class="bio__photo"><img src="/paolo-danese.jpg" alt="Paolo Danese" width="480" height="600"></div>
        <h3 class="bio__name">Paolo Danese</h3>
        <p class="bio__body">Paolo Danese founded <strong>Storya</strong>, an AI publishing platform that grew to 3,000 users and 1,000 independent authors across more than 20 languages before it was wound down in 2023. Much of what he knows about building AI that people keep using comes from that, including the parts that didn't work. Before Storya he spent close to a decade as a financial journalist at <strong>Euromoney Institutional Investor</strong>, where he ran <em>GlobalRMB</em>, the first English-language publication covering China's currency internationalisation, and then led content and media relations for institutional finance clients as a <strong>VP at FleishmanHillard</strong> in Hong Kong. He has published five epic fantasy novels and runs an AI agent that manages the Amazon Ads on them.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="bio__photo"><img src="/rafael-soriano.jpg" alt="Rafael Soriano" width="480" height="600"></div>
        <h3 class="bio__name">Rafael Soriano</h3>
        <p class="bio__body">Rafael Soriano, MBA, leads partnerships and the adoption side of StoryaConsulting's work: getting the people who have to live with a new tool to want it. Rafael has spent more than twenty years getting organisations with different agendas to agree on something and then act on it, through corporate innovation programmes, public-private partnerships and cross-border alliances in Singapore, Asia-Pacific and the United States.</p>
        <p class="bio__body" style="margin-top:1rem">Rafael spent 8 years in Marketing and PR for <strong>Industrial Bank</strong> in Washington D.C. As a consultant he helped the <strong>Association for Financial Professionals</strong> with their APAC expansion. In 2024 Rafael co-founded <strong>Akitsu Consulting</strong>, a Singapore based boutique consultancy specialising in strategic partnerships and business development.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta" aria-label="Get in touch">
    <p class="cta__line">Bring what you've tried.</p>
    <p class="cta__line cta__line--accent">And what didn't stick.</p>
    <p class="cta__sub">Twenty minutes, over coffee in Singapore or on a call. If we're not useful, you'll know inside the first ten.</p>
    <div class="cta-row">
      <a class="btn" href="/start">Tell us what stalled</a>
      <span class="cta-row__aside">Or write to <a href="mailto:paolo@storyaconsulting.com">paolo@storyaconsulting.com</a></span>
    </div>
  </section>
